      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1685948339,
      "version": 466,
      "versionNonce": 1869999805,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782881179140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 1:1 chats and group chats(upto 500 members)\n- Delivery Status (sent, delivered, read)\n- Last seen stats (online, offline, last seen\ntime)\n- Message history sync across multiple devices\n- Push notifications for new messages\n- Send/Receive Media messages like - images,\nvideos, voice notes",
      "fontSize": 15.957333170572902,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 1:1 chats and group chats(upto 500 members)\n- Delivery Status (sent, delivered, read)\n- Last seen stats (online, offline, last seen time)\n- Message history sync across multiple devices\n- Push notifications for new messages\n- Send/Receive Media messages like - images, videos, voice notes",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0B5-xX5Jbt7PNqiK60NEt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1120.5875008079158,
      "y": 469.12240265387396,
      "width": 462.19886324406684,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 20544307,
      "version": 758,
      "versionNonce": 1075705541,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783872913677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Low Latency for online users. Target P99 < 100ms\nwhen receipient is online\n- High availability (99.99% uptime)\n- Reliable messaging, never lost.\n- Scalability - 500M+ DAU, 40 msgs/person -> 20B+\nmessages/day\n- Correct ordering of messages\n- Consistent. Exactly once delivery with no\nduplicates.\n- Fault Tolerant",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Low Latency for online users. Target P99 < 100ms when receipient is online\n- High availability (99.99% uptime)\n- Reliable messaging, never lost.\n- Scalability - 500M+ DAU, 40 msgs/person -> 20B+ messages/day\n- Correct ordering of messages\n- Consistent. Exactly once delivery with no duplicates.\n- Fault Tolerant",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
