      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DEEP DIVES",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DEEP DIVES",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "T4CTyvDnxpNTmqlgQ0RX1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7711.041060674844,
      "y": 405.7973760192692,
      "width": 542.079833984375,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 207560156,
      "version": 136,
      "versionNonce": 1223095396,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784484112413,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Should we partition by chat or by user?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Should we partition by chat or by user?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WVYP_rxEvl7PMFAOh-qds",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7729.245534681878,
      "y": 484.49386622563117,
      "width": 871.6527396832079,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 542380508,
      "version": 311,
      "versionNonce": 944949220,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784484112413,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scenario 1 - 250 chats but 1:1 chats\n\n-> If we partition by chat the total number of channels in the system is 125\nper user (250 chats / 2 since each chat is shared). But each chat server still\nneeds to subscribe to 250 channels per connected user (one for each of that\nuser's chats). \n\nWhen a message is sent, the server publishes to just 1 channel.\n\n-> If we partition by user there's 1 channel per user. Each chat server\nsubscribes to 1 channel per connected user. When a message is sent, the server\npublishes to 1 channel (the recipient's).\n\nIn this scenario it should be obvious we prefer to partition by user — 1\nsubscription per user instead of 250.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scenario 1 - 250 chats but 1:1 chats\n\n-> If we partition by chat the total number of channels in the system is 125 per user (250 chats / 2 since each chat is shared). But each chat server still needs to subscribe to 250 channels per connected user (one for each of that user's chats). \n\nWhen a message is sent, the server publishes to just 1 channel.\n\n-> If we partition by user there's 1 channel per user. Each chat server subscribes to 1 channel per connected user. When a message is sent, the server publishes to 1 channel (the recipient's).\n\nIn this scenario it should be obvious we prefer to partition by user — 1 subscription per user instead of 250.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hP9qv2qETWUqttzMFMtRP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8745.749563624926,
      "y": 478.92417877040265,
      "width": 871.6527396832079,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1182705636,
      "version": 456,
      "versionNonce": 454731876,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784485580893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scenario 2 - Users have 1 chat but each with 100 participants\n\n-> If we partition by chat the total number of channels is 1 per 100 users\n(since all 100 share a single chat channel). \n\nEach chat server subscribes to 1 channel per connected user. When a message is\nsent, the server publishes to just 1 channel.\n\n->If we partition by user there's 1 channel per user. Each chat server\nsubscribes to 1 channel per connected user. \n\nWhen a message is sent, the server has to publish to 99 channels (one for each\nother participant).In this scenario, we save on the number of publishes by\nhaving channels partitioned by chat.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scenario 2 - Users have 1 chat but each with 100 participants\n\n-> If we partition by chat the total number of channels is 1 per 100 users (since all 100 share a single chat channel). \n\nEach chat server subscribes to 1 channel per connected user. When a message is sent, the server publishes to just 1 channel.\n\n->If we partition by user there's 1 channel per user. Each chat server subscribes to 1 channel per connected user. \n\nWhen a message is sent, the server has to publish to 99 channels (one for each other participant).In this scenario, we save on the number of publishes by having channels partitioned by chat.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eIQBfabdkb10tK1bVU2HJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9775.086712745713,
      "y": 471.3634868155214,
      "width": 916.3258340978555,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 722049500,
      "version": 394,
      "versionNonce": 1911552996,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784485580893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "An uncommon edge case (large chats) is disproportionately impacting the system. A\ngood solution is to adaptively change the partitioning strategy based on the size\nof the chat.\n\nWhen users connect, list out all the chats they are part of which are larger than\nsome threshold (say, 25 users). They'll subscribe to channels for those chats\nspecifically in addition to the user-level channels. When a message is sent, if the\nchat is larger than the threshold, we'll publish to the chat-level channel instead\nof the user-level channel. There's edge cases here: you need to be careful that you\ngive time for the chat servers to subscribe when the chat size changes, so you\nmight be publishing to both channels for a short time.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "An uncommon edge case (large chats) is disproportionately impacting the system. A good solution is to adaptively change the partitioning strategy based on the size of the chat.\n\nWhen users connect, list out all the chats they are part of which are larger than some threshold (say, 25 users). They'll subscribe to channels for those chats specifically in addition to the user-level channels. When a message is sent, if the chat is larger than the threshold, we'll publish to the chat-level channel instead of the user-level channel. There's edge cases here: you need to be careful that you give time for the chat servers to subscribe when the chat size changes, so you might be publishing to both channels for a short time.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nSRfZAjD8pLYsXvJlIIqY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9774.518275365355,
      "y": 413.42868928619646,
      "width": 233.29588317871094,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 556220764,
      "version": 192,
      "versionNonce": 2043600740,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784485580893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Celebrity Problem",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Celebrity Problem",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "epQEAxG7lISwN9HLKk3Xg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7709.057995109318,
      "y": 960.3521748654305,
      "width": 543.3677368164062,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2038580956,
      "version": 121,
      "versionNonce": 713930212,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784484112413,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Handling multiple clients for a given user",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Handling multiple clients for a given user",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ECw0MrJi083FDludgPE-D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7725.4645794038,
      "y": 1039.4843247039032,
      "width": 871.6527396832079,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 886872924,
      "version": 472,
      "versionNonce": 178608484,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784484112413,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Imagine my phone had received the latest message but my laptop was off. When I\nwake it up, I want to make sure that all of the latest messages are delivered\nto my laptop so that it's in sync.\n\n-> Add a way for our design to resolve a user to 1 or more clients that may be\nactive at any one time.\n\n-> Way to deactivate clients so that we're not unnecessarily storing messages\nfor a client which does not exist any longer.\n\n-> Update our message delivery system so that it can handle multiple clients.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Imagine my phone had received the latest message but my laptop was off. When I wake it up, I want to make sure that all of the latest messages are delivered to my laptop so that it's in sync.\n\n-> Add a way for our design to resolve a user to 1 or more clients that may be active at any one time.\n\n-> Way to deactivate clients so that we're not unnecessarily storing messages for a client which does not exist any longer.\n\n-> Update our message delivery system so that it can handle multiple clients.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cu_KIrt6sDSAQf07mFhV3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8736.447770720515,
      "y": 1020.0256347925231,
      "width": 871.6527396832079,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2063205340,
      "version": 989,
      "versionNonce": 2063946468,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784485580893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> Create a new Clients table to keep track of clients by user id.\n\n-> When we look up participants for a chat, we'll need to look up all of the\nclients for that user.\n\n-> We'll need to UPDATE our Inbox table to be per-client rather than per-user.\n\n-> When we send a message, we'll need to send it to all of the clients for that\nuser.\n\n-> On the pub/sub side, nothing needs to change. Chat servers will continue to\nsubscribe to a topic with the userId.\n\n\nIntroduce some limits (3 clients per account) to avoid blowing up our storage\nand throughput. Why this is limit is needed?\n\nEarlier Inbox table had rows of user x messages\nNow Inbox table will have user x messages x clients/user rows",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> Create a new Clients table to keep track of clients by user id.\n\n-> When we look up participants for a chat, we'll need to look up all of the clients for that user.\n\n-> We'll need to UPDATE our Inbox table to be per-client rather than per-user.\n\n-> When we send a message, we'll need to send it to all of the clients for that user.\n\n-> On the pub/sub side, nothing needs to change. Chat servers will continue to subscribe to a topic with the userId.\n\n\nIntroduce some limits (3 clients per account) to avoid blowing up our storage and throughput. Why this is limit is needed?\n\nEarlier Inbox table had rows of user x messages\nNow Inbox table will have user x messages x clients/user rows",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
